tun2socks daemon (xjasonlyu/tun2socks)

Native OPNsense MVC plugin (no Go controller). Manages tun2socks
(gVisor TCP/IP stack), which forwards traffic arriving on a TUN
interface through an upstream SOCKS5 proxy. Typically paired with
os-mosdns: resolved proxy domains are injected into a pf table,
policy-routed into the TUN device, and tun2socks hands them to a
local xray-core outbound.

WWW: https://github.com/nxovaeng/nxova-opn-repo
